license: MIT
abstract: >
  A reproducible framework for shape-first behavioral segmentation of 
  household energy consumption that separates magnitude from temporal 
  patterns through 51 scale-invariant features, PCA dimensionality 
  reduction, and evidence-based K selection with comprehensive stability 
  validation. Achieves ARI=0.813 recovery on controlled synthetic data 
  with 200 consumers over 365 days. Includes interactive web explorer 
  and Streamlit simulator for real-time analysis.
